; atleast_charge_before_unset_model: ATLEAST is charged its expansion
; before it reads its model register, so an unset model under an exhausted
; budget raises MemoryLimitExceeded rather than UnsetRegister.
;
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md orders pops, then the allocation charge, then
; validation. ATLEAST's charge is computed from its operands -- the indices
; and k -- so it is paid whatever the model register holds. k = 1 is inside
; (0, 2], so the k range check passes. The two VECPUSHes spend the budget
; of 32 bytes exactly, so the charge is refused before r0 is read.

VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]; 32 bytes: the whole budget
PUSH 1           ; k, in range
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEAST r0 r1    ; r0 was never written
HALT
